Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Expected: 200 OK, user object

###
# AUTH: Get all users (principal only)
GET https://e-dispy.onrender.com/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Expected: 200 OK, list of users

